### POST Crear director
POST http://localhost:8080/director

{
  "name": "Guillermo del Toro",
  "anioNacimiento": 1964
}

### POST Crear pelicula
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/peliculas

{
  "titulo": "El laberinto del fauno",
  "genero": "Fantasía",
  "fechaEstreno": "2006-10-11",
  "directorId": 1
}

### POST Crear actor
POST http://localhost:8080/actor

{
  "name": "Ivana Baquero"
}

### POST Asignar actor a pelicula
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/peliculas/1/actores/1




### GET Traer directores
GET http://localhost:8080/director

### GET Traer director según ID
GET http://localhost:8080/director/1

### GET Traer actores
GET http://localhost:8080/actor

### GET Traer actor según ID
GET http://localhost:8080/actor/1

### GET Traer peliculas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/peliculas

### GET Traer pelicula según ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/peliculas/1